OL,4,CReform bid to oust presiding officer   
OL,5,Cfails after its Senedd boycott ends    
OL,6,GAn attempt by Reform UK to remove the  
OL,7,GSenedd's Presiding Officer has failed, 
OL,8,Gfollowing a passionate speech to the   
OL,9,GWelsh Parliament by Huw Irranca-Davies.
OL,11,FMembers of the Senedd (MSs) rejected   
OL,12,FReform's motion by 55 votes to 29.     
OL,14,FEarlier the party ended a two-week     
OL,15,Fboycott of most proceedings in the     
OL,16,Fchamber after one of them, Joe Martin, 
OL,17,Fwas banned from speaking and told to   
OL,18,Fapologise for remarks about            
OL,19,Fimmigration.                           
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
