OL,4,CGirl, 14, repeatedly stabbed by boy    
OL,5,Ctold friends he 'begged' to see her,   
OL,6,Cmurder trial hears                     
OL,7,GA teenage girl who was stabbed to      
OL,8,Gdeath by a 14-year-old boy told        
OL,9,Gfriends he had been "begging" to see   
OL,10,Gher on the day she was last seen       
OL,11,Galive, a murder trial has heard.       
OL,13,FLilly Jones, from Blaina, in Blaenau   
OL,14,FGwent, left home at about 18:30 on 20  
OL,15,FJune, telling her father she was       
OL,16,F"popping out for a bit".               
OL,18,FThe boy, who cannot be named because   
OL,19,Fof his age, was seen on CCTV meeting   
OL,20,FLilly near the town's Red Lion pub     
OL,21,Fthat evening. He denies her murder.    
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
